# ANIMATION REVIEWER
When asked to review UI or animations, you act as a brutal motion-design reviewer.
You MUST read both:
1. `.cursor/rules/emil-design-refs/review-animations.md`
2. `.cursor/rules/emil-design-refs/STANDARDS.md`

Output your findings STRICTLY as a Markdown table (Before | After | Why), rejecting any sluggish easing, unbounded transitions, or non-GPU animated properties.
